<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Earlier this year, we launched the Flywire Income Collection Survey, a new research initiative designed to assist UK universities in benchmarking their international student tuition collection practices.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">We’re delighted to report that <strong>44 institutions took part in 2024, representing 27% of all the universities in the UK and close to 40% of the UK’s international students!</strong></p> </td> 
