<tr> 
<td align="center" height="180" valign="top" width="381" class="st-equal-height" style="height: 180px;"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Flywire has partnered with HDFC Credila, India's largest independent student loan provider, to enable Indian payers to seamlessly and digitally disburse their loan payments in Indian Rupees directly to higher education institutions worldwide.&nbsp;</p> </td> 
