<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">If you are an existing WPM Extranet user, we’re pleased to share that it will soon be replaced by our new and improved WPM Dashboard this November.&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">The new WPM Dashboard will provide you with the same benefit of managing payments created in the Payment Gateway, whilst improving your experience as a client.&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">You'll receive further updates closer to the time. In the meantime, you can watch a <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/on-demand-webinar-wpm-dashboard-preview-webinar-replay?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>replay</u></strong></span></a> of our recent webinar for an overview of the WPM Dashboard.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
